---
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
import { liteText } from '../../variant';

const c = profile.contact;
const portfolioLabel = c.portfolio.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '');
const linkedinLabel = c.linkedin.replace(/^https?:\/\/(www\.)?/, '');

const wota = [
  'Led planning and interface design for the v3.0 website redesign: built 11 shared component libraries and ran pre-launch UAT, with all 30 issues fixed before launch; reworked type and layout for a luxury brand and surfaced deals in search. Within 30 days of launch, hotel-page booking rate rose above 10% (from 1–5%) and UI bugs fell from 10–30 to under 10.',
  'Owned interface design, product management, and QA for hotel booking inside LINE (LIFF): launched in May 2026, then added credit-card payment for memberships and English in July. Wrote the design system guide that lets the website and LINE share one set of components.',
  'Pulled Journey Rewards earning, tier, and redemption rules into a PRD and 4 clickable prototypes: defined 18 redemption states and laid out options for each of 28 tier rules so the team could decide. Compared a new proposal against current rules and found 4 places where it would change existing member benefits.',
  'Led copy management across four languages: brought 3,548 pieces of website copy into Figma in Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, English, and Japanese; personally reviewed 138 judgment calls; a check of bound Figma text against the live site found zero mismatches.',
  'Initiated website behavior analysis, cross-checking session recordings with analytics: found that login is where bookings stall. After "Select rate," only 9% of logged-out visitors reached the booking form, versus 50% of members. Turned the findings into a 41-item, evidence-backed backlog with weekly automated tracking.',
  'Built an internal review tool (UI Spec) in the existing codebase with AI (Claude Code): design, PM, and QA can see 129 member screen states without switching accounts, cutting a check from about 30 minutes to under a minute (estimated); it runs only in development. Verification surfaced 2 bugs already affecting members.',
].map((s) => liteText(s, 'en'));

const fusion = [
  'Owned product UI systems, UX flows, sitemaps, wireframes, and prototypes; designed responsive web interfaces with engineers.',
  'Designed the full product UI/UX for Doweing, a map-based travel journal and community app, which shipped.',
];

const skills = [
  ['Product', 'Requirements, user flows, edge cases, launch QA', 'PRD · IA · UAT · Jira'],
  ['Design', 'Design systems, prototyping, localization, accessibility', 'Figma · design tokens · i18n · WCAG'],
  ['AI & frontend', 'AI-assisted development · HTML / CSS', 'Claude Code · ChatGPT · Codex'],
  ['Research', 'User interviews, usability testing, behavior analysis', 'Mixpanel · Clarity · GTM'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Kenny Cheng · Senior Product Designer Resume</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  :root { --ink: #0E2240; --ink-2: #3D4D66; --ink-3: #76849A; --line: #D9E0EA; --accent: #2F64A8; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; background: #E9EDF2; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--ink); -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  .page { width: 210mm; height: 297mm; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 13mm 15mm 11mm; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
  @media screen { .page { margin: 24px auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(14,34,64,.12); } }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10mm; padding-bottom: 4mm; border-bottom: 1.4pt solid var(--ink); }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-weight: 300; font-size: 24pt; letter-spacing: .01em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .role { margin-top: 1.6mm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); }
  .contact { text-align: right; font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); white-space: nowrap; }
  .summary { margin: 3.4mm 0 0; font-size: 9.2pt; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); }
  h2 { margin: 4.2mm 0 1.8mm; font-size: 8.6pt; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3mm; }
  h2::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: .6pt; background: var(--line); }
  .job { margin-bottom: 2.4mm; }
  .job-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 4mm; }
  .job-head b { font-size: 10.2pt; font-weight: 600; }
  .job-head span.org { font-size: 9.2pt; color: var(--ink-2); margin-left: 2mm; }
  .job-head time { font-size: 8.5pt; color: var(--ink-3); white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  ul { margin: 1.1mm 0 0; padding-left: 4.2mm; }
  li { font-size: 8.7pt; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: .8mm; }
  li::marker { color: var(--accent); }
  .early { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: .9mm 3mm; font-size: 8.7pt; color: var(--ink-2); align-items: baseline; }
  .early b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 9.1pt; }
  .early time { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 8.5pt; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bottom { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1fr; gap: 8mm; }
  .skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 1mm 3mm; font-size: 8.7pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  .skills dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; }
  .skills dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .side p { margin: 0 0 1.3mm; font-size: 8.7pt; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .side p b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .skills dd .tools { color: var(--ink-3); }
  footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 3mm; border-top: .6pt solid var(--line); font-size: 8pt; color: var(--ink-3); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <header>
    <div>
      <h1>Kenny Cheng</h1>
      <div class="role">Senior Product Designer</div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact">
      <div><a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a>{c.phoneIntl && <> · {c.phoneIntl}</>}</div>
      <div><a href={c.portfolio}>{portfolioLabel}</a></div>
      <div><a href={c.linkedin}>{linkedinLabel}</a></div>
      <div>New Taipei City · Taipei, Taiwan (GMT+8) · Remote or hybrid</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <p class="summary">Product designer with 8+ years in digital products, after 8+ years in brand design. At a luxury hotel booking platform, I take the website, LINE booking (LIFF), and white-label sites for bank partners from requirements through launch QA, aligning rules with product and engineering. AI speeds up research, docs, and code; I make the calls and sign off.</p>

  <h2>Experience</h2>
  <div class="job">
    <div class="job-head"><div><b>Product Designer</b><span class="org">Wota Lifestyle · luxury travel and hotel booking platform</span></div><time>Mar 2023 — Present</time></div>
    <ul>{wota.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
  </div>
  <div class="job">
    <div class="job-head"><div><b>UI/UX Designer</b><span class="org">Fusion Next · IoT app and cloud platform, Taipei</span></div><time>Aug 2018 — Mar 2023</time></div>
    <ul>{fusion.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Brand and visual design foundation</h2>
  <div class="early">
    <b>Visual Design Director</b><span>Taichung Guangtian Temple · multimedia lead; brand visuals, web planning, project acceptance</span><time>Apr 2014 — Feb 2018</time>
    <b>Design Director</b><span>Daizhan (food retail) · team of 3–4; identity, packaging, catalogues, prepress</span><time>Oct 2010 — Dec 2013</time>
    <b>Graphic Designer</b><span>DIDIWORLD Company Ltd. (textiles) · print collateral, layout, print production</span><time>Sep 2009 — Sep 2010</time>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom">
    <div>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <dl class="skills">{skills.map(([k, plain, tools]) => <><dt>{k}</dt><dd>{plain}<br><span class="tools">{tools}</span></dd></>)}</dl>
    </div>
    <div class="side">
      <h2>Education and languages</h2>
      <p><b>Tunghai University</b> BFA, Fine Arts</p>
      <p><b>Languages</b> Mandarin (native) · Taiwanese Hokkien (intermediate)<br>English (intermediate reading and writing)</p>
      <h2>Portfolio</h2>
      <p>Featured: booking platform, behavior analysis<br>Also: member rewards, UI Spec tool</p>
      <p><a href={c.portfolio}>{portfolioLabel}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer><span>Kenny Cheng · Senior Product Designer</span><span>Nov 2026</span></footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
